1 NOTE Also known as Henry II. The Fratricide
2 CONT Illigitimate son of Alfonso XI of Castile and Eleonor de Guzman, Half brother of Pedro de Castile. He took the throne from Pedro and killed him in the Castilian civil war 1336 through 1369
2 CONT First king to use anti Semitism as a political tool in Espagna..
