2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Signore di Pacentro; Conte associato di Tagliacozzo e Alba, Signore di Sant’Angelo, San Polo & San Gregorio jointly with his brothers and nephews; General in the service of the Pope and of the Senesi.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Violante Sanseverino;
2 CONT
