2 CONT - http://www.treccani.it/enciclopedia/orazio-giambattista-ravaschieri_(Dizionario-Biografico)/
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT From Wikipédia: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orazio_Giovan_Battista_Ravaschieri_Fieschi
2 CONT
2 CONT Orazio Giovan Battista Ravaschieri Fieschi (died 12 October 1645) was a wealthy nobleman and patrician ('patrizio') of Genoa descending from the Fieschi, Counts Palatine of Lavagna, in what is now Liguria. He was appointed Grand S
2 CONC eneschal of Naples ('Gran Siniscalco del Regno di Sicilia'), and, on 5 March 1619, he was elevated to the title of Prince of Belmonte at Madrid by Philip III of Spain.[1] Orazio descended from a line of imperial and royal bankers,
2 CONC  his great-grandfather Giovan Battista and grandfather having been Treasurers (Maestri di Zecca) to Charles V, Holy Roman Emperor, and King Philip II of Spain respectively. Prince Belmonte was the grandson of Germano Ravaschieri F
2 CONC ieschi and Antonia Scorza, and the son of Giovan Battista Ravaschieri Fieschi, 1st Baron of Belmonte and 1st Baron of Badolato and his wife Maria, the heiress of the feudality of Girifalco from her uncle Pietro Francesco Ravaschie
2 CONC ri Fieschi. Maria was herself the daughter of Torino Ravaschieri Fieschi, Treasurer of Calabria, and his wife Vittoria Spinola. Upon Orazio's death his titles and estates passed to his son, Daniele Domenico Ravaschieri Fieschi, 2n
2 CONC d Prince of Belmonte.
2 CONT
2 CONT Summary (from http://dictionnaire.sensagent.leparisien.fr/don+orazio+giovan+battista+ravaschieri+fieschi+1st+prince+of+belmonte/en-en/)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st Prince of Belmonte Reign : ? - 1645
2 CONT
2 CONT Titles Prince of Belmonte Baron of Belmonte Baron of Tortora
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: 12 October 1645
2 CONT
2 CONT Predecessor : Don Giovan Battista Ravaschieri Fieschi, 1st Baron of Belmonte, 1st Baron of Badolato
2 CONT
2 CONT Successor: Don Daniele Domenico Ravaschieri Fieschi, 2nd Prince of Belmonte
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife: Donna Anna Maria Carracciolo Pisquizi, of the Lords (later Dukes) of Sicignano
2 CONT
2 CONT Offspring:
2 CONT
2 CONT Don Daniele,  Don Ramiro (+1684, pre-deceased by son Don Gennaro Francesco +1662),  Donna Maria Teresina (Abbess)
2 CONT
2 CONT Dynasty: Ravaschieri Fieschi di Belmonte
2 CONT
