1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Alfonsina Orsini''' (1472 – 7 February 1520) was a Regent of Florence. She was the spouse of Piero di Lorenzo de' Medici from 1488 and the mother of Lorenzo II de' Medici. She was the daughter of Roberto Orsini,
2 CONC  Conte Tagliacozzo and Catherine San Severino.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is credited with a great influence over the affairs of state. She governed The Republic of Florence during the absence of her son in the period of 1515-1519. She was involved in the plans regarding the war between Florence and
2 CONC  France, as well as in the plans of making a treaty. She also had oversight of Pope Leo's entry into Florence in November 1515.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfonsina Orsini's maid, Simonetta da Collevecchio, was to-be the mother of Alessandro de' Medici.
2 CONT
2 CONT From: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alfonsina_Orsini
2 CONT ------
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/G8QG-J68
2 CONT *'''Alfonsina Orsini
2 CONT *'''F, #4789, b. circa 1472, d. 7 February 1520
2 CONT *Last Edited=18 Sep 2002
2 CONT *'''     Alfonsina Orsini was born circa 1472. She was the daughter of Robert Orsini, Conte di Tagliacozzo and Catherine Saint-Severin. She married Piero II de Medici, son of Lorenzo I de Medici and Clara Orsini, circa 1487. She d
2 CONC ied on 7 February 1520.
2 CONT *'''Child of Alfonsina Orsini and Piero II de Medici
2 CONT **1. Lorenzo II de Medici, Duca di Urbino+ b. 9 Sep 1492, d. 4 May 1519
2 CONT
2 CONT From: http://thepeerage.com/p479.htm#i4789
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Alfonsina d' Orsini1
2 CONT *F, #98848
2 CONT *Father      Roberto d' Orsini, Count of Tagliacozzo & Alba, Signore di Pacentro, Sant'Angelo, San Polo, & San Gregorio1 b. c 1425, d. 29 Jun 1476
2 CONT *Mother     Caterina (Violante) Sanseverino1 b. c 1425
2 CONT *'''     Alfonsina d' Orsini married Piero 'the Unfortunate' di Lorenzo de Medici, Lord of Florence, son of Lorenzo I 'the Magnificent' de Medici, Lord of Florence and Clarice d' Orsini, in 1488.1
2 CONT *'''Family      Piero 'the Unfortunate' di Lorenzo de Medici, Lord of Florence b. 15 Feb 1471, d. 28 Dec 1503
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Lorenzo II de Medici, Duke d'Urbino+1 b. 12 Sep 1492, d. 4 May 1519
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S13] Worldroots.com.
2 CONT
