2 CONC lladolid, 1332 – 1333) and Pedro of Castile.
2 CONT
2 CONT By his mistress, Eleanor of Guzman, he had ten children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Pedro, 1st Lord of Aguilar de Campoo (1330 - 1338)
2 CONT * Juana, 1st Lady of follar Trastamara (born 1330)
2 CONT * Sancho, 1st Lord of Ledesma (1331 - 1343)
2 CONT * Henry of Trastamara (1334 - 1379)
2 CONT * Fadrique, Master of the Order of Santiago and 1st Lord of Haro; (born 1335)
2 CONT * Fernando, 2nd Lord of Ledesma
2 CONT * Tello, 1st Lord of Aguilar de Campoo (1337-1370)
2 CONT * Juan, 1st Lord of Badajoz and Jerez de la Frontera (1341 - 1359)
2 CONT * Sancho of Alburquerque (1342-1375)
2 CONT * Pedro (1345 - 1359) After Alfonso's death, his widow Maria had Eleanor arrested and later killed (1).
