2 CONT
2 CONT She married, firstly, Giovanni Sforza, son of Costanzo I Sforza, on 12 June 1492. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 24 June 1519 at age 39 at Ferrara, Italy, from birth complications. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her marriage to Giovanni Sforza was annulled. (1)
