2 CONT
2 CONT Don Francesco Maria Marescotti, Principe Ruspoli (March 5, 1672 – July 14, 1731) was the ?th Marchese and 1st Principe di Cerveteri, 1st Marchese di Riano and 6th Conte di Vignanello.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a son of Alessandro Ruspoli, 5th Conte di Vignanello and first wife Anna Maria dei Marchesi Corsini.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also he was a paternal grandson of Sforza Vicino Marescotti, 4th Conte di Vignanello and wife Vittoria dei Principi Ruspoli dei Marchesi di Cerveteri (? – Rome, February 11, 1681).
2 CONT
2 CONT His son was Bartolomeo Ruspoli.
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://www.treccani.it/enciclopedia/francesco-maria-ruspoli_%28Dizionario-Biografico%29/
